  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "英國文學：古典與復興",
    "sub_ename": "ENGLISH LITERATURE: ANTIQUITY AND REVIVAL",
    "describe_ch": "本課程涵蓋了英國文學早期、中世紀時期及十六、十七世紀文藝復興時期、復辟時期與十八世紀新古典時期主要作家及他們的代表性作品。除了閱讀之外，修習本課程之學生將學習並練習如何欣賞、分析、詮釋、及討論這些屬於各式類別且具有多樣性主題的文學作品。不僅如此，透過了解作者們的原創性及對英國文學的貢獻，學生們將能明確地理解每一個文學時期的特色與人類智慧及生活經驗的累積。",
    "describe_eh": "This survey course covers the major authors and their representative works in English literature in the early periods、the middle ages and the Renaissance in the sixteenth and seventeenth century、the Restoration and the Neoclassical period. In addition to close reading, students will also learn how to appreciate, analyze, interpret, and discuss the literary works, which are of various genres and on diverse topics. Moreover, through understanding the originality of the authors and the contributions they made to English literature, students will have a good grasp of the characteristics of each of the important literary periods in English literature study.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
